      "published_at": "2026-11-20T15:24:11+00:00",
      "full_text": "Weekend Hours\nOpen Saturday 8:00 AM – 4:00 PM. Emergency shut-off calls answered 24 hours a day.\nMake your site look hastily vibecoded.\nIt's not just a CSS framework — it's a load-bearing accelerant to make anything look like it was made by an LLM.\n<!-- 1. Include Slopstrap CSS & JS -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./dist/slopstrap.css\" />\n<script src=\"./dist/slopstrap.js\" defer></script>\n<!-- 2. Enable full-page dark mode & ambient orbs -->\n<body class=\"slop-body slop-grid-bg\">\n  <div class=\"slop-orb-layer\">\n    <div class=\"slop-orb slop-orb-purple\"></div>\n    <div class=\"slop-orb slop-orb-cyan\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Your content goes here ✨ -->\n</body>\n        Simple components you can copy-paste into your site to make it look like it was generated by a water-guzzling, nascent machine-god.\nDual-ring animated ping dots to project real-time urgency onto static HTML.\n<span class=\"slop-status\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-green\"></span>\n  All Systems Operational\n</span>\n<span class=\"slop-status\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-purple\"></span>\n  AI Engine Active\n</span>\n<!-- Variants: green, purple, cyan, amber, pink, red, indigo, rainbow -->\n<span class=\"slop-status\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-rainbow\"></span>\n  RGB Overclocked\n</span>\nWhen the machines send us to our nutrient pods, the orders will come with a colorful left border\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-border-l-purple\">\n  Purple 4px accent stripe\n</div>\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-border-l-cyan\">\n  Cyan 4px accent stripe\n</div>\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-border-l-gradient\">\n  Glowing purple-to-cyan gradient stripe\n</div>\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-border-l-rainbow\">\n  Animated vertical RGB left beam ✨\n</div>\nRounded pills to slap onto literally everything\n<div class=\"slop-pill slop-pill-shimmer\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-purple\"></span>\n  ✨ Introducing v2.0 — Now Live →\n</div>\n<span class=\"slop-badge slop-badge-popular\">✨ MOST POPULAR</span>\n<span class=\"slop-badge slop-badge-ai\">AI-POWERED</span>\n<span class=\"slop-badge slop-badge-emerald\">✓ VERIFIED</span>\n<span class=\"slop-badge slop-badge-cyan\">BETA</span>\n<span class=\"slop-badge slop-badge-amber\">EARLY ACCESS</span>\nInter that bleeds technicolor. Body copy that's a murky gray.\nIt’s not just body copy — it’s washed-out low-contrast slate-400 engineered for maximum SaaS authority.\n<h1 class=\"slop-h1 slop-text-gradient\">\n  Supercharge your workflow at scale\n</h1>\n<h3 class=\"slop-h3 slop-text-gradient-hot\">\n  Hot Magenta-to-Indigo Subheading\n</h3>\n<h3 class=\"slop-h3 slop-text-gradient-animated\">\n  Animated Rainbow Text\n</h3>\n<p class=\"slop-muted slop-sparkle\">\n  Low-contrast slate body copy with automatic ✨ prefix.\n</p>\nMake your probabilistically-generated prose feel deeply intentional.\n<h2 class=\"slop-h2\">\n  Build the <span class=\"slop-serif-emphasis\">future</span> of work.\n</h2>\n<!-- Pair with a gradient for peak 2026 slop -->\n<h2 class=\"slop-h2\">\n  Ship at <span class=\"slop-serif-emphasis slop-text-gradient-hot\">unprecedented</span> velocity.\n</h2>\nBecause this shit was pretty hard to do like four years ago.\n<!-- Default swooping purple-pink marker underline -->\nMake your <span class=\"slop-underline\">site</span> look vibecoded.\n<!-- Styles: default | .slop-underline-double | .slop-underline-squiggle -->\n<!-- Colors: default | cyan | amber | emerald | pink | rainbow -->\n<!-- Draw-in animation: .slop-underline-animated -->\n<span class=\"slop-underline slop-underline-double slop-underline-amber\">\n  10x faster\n</span>\n<span class=\"slop-underline slop-underline-squiggle slop-underline-rainbow\">\n  animated RGB\n</span>\nGlowing cards inside of glowing cards inside of glowing cards.\nBecause one rounded box is never enough.\n                    Continuous CSS @property conic gradient animation around the entire container\n                    perimeter.\n                  \n<!-- Glass Card + Icon Squircle + Nested Card -->\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-border-l-purple\">\n  <div class=\"slop-icon-box\">⚡</div>\n  <h3 class=\"slop-h3\">⚡ Glass Card</h3>\n  <p class=\"slop-muted\">With cursor spotlight.</p>\n  <div class=\"slop-card-nested slop-border-l-cyan\">\n    📦 Card inside a card\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rotating Conic Border Beam Card -->\n<div class=\"slop-card slop-card-beam\">\n  <div class=\"slop-icon-box slop-icon-cyan\">🌀</div>\n  <h3 class=\"slop-h3\">🌀 Rotating Border Beam</h3>\n</div>\n            Dark frosted callout boxes accented with thick colored left stripes, blinking dots, and gratuitous emojis.\n.slop-serif-emphasis\n                    for instant sophistication.\n<div class=\"slop-alert slop-border-l-purple\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-purple\"></span>\n  <div><strong>✨ AI Insight:</strong> Injected 14 orbs.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slop-alert slop-border-l-emerald\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-green\"></span>\n  <div><strong>🚀 Deployment Ready:</strong> All vibes green.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slop-alert slop-border-l-amber\">\n  <span class=\"slop-dot slop-dot-amber\"></span>\n  <div><strong>⚡ Pro T",
